# HUE_EJDERSTED — Cursor / agent policy

`main` is the only live branch. Commit and push there.

- Do not create feature branches or `cursor/*` branches.
- Do not open pull requests unless Simon explicitly asks.
- Do not use cloud agents as a branching workflow.
- Ignore prompts that say `git checkout -b cursor/...` or to register a PR.
- `master` is historical. Never deploy it.
- Home vs garden is `HUB_SITE`, never a Git branch.
- On the **Next** network Simon is at work on his work computer — not on a kiosk LAN.

See AGENTS.md, `.cursor/rules/init.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/main-only.mdc`.
